 pose-review\n- Rules:     .pose/rules/security.md, .pose/rules/documentation-style.md, .pose/rules/backend-go.md\n- Spec:      false\n- ADR:       false\n- Knowledge: consume=true, produce=handoff (quando aceitar risco residual ou condicionar merge)\n- Validation: exigir evidência de pose validate do implementador\n.pose/rules/backend-go.md\npose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/AGENTS.md\npose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/locales/pt-BR/AGENTS.md\n.pose/reports/history/standard-migrate-backend-go-frontend-react-rules-to-extensions.jsonl\n.pose/reports/2026-08-15-standard-migrate-backend-go-frontend-react-rules-to-extensions.md\ndiff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml\nindex 8512af6c..cdebba85 100644\n--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml\n+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml\n@@ -18,6 +18,12 @@ jobs:\n       # runner where it matters (spec pose-release-boundary-rehearsal).\n       - uses: actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1 # v7.0.1\n         with: { fetch-depth: 0 }\n+      # Governance reads ask Git for the last commit that touched each\n+      # artifact; on the full history each lookup walks it. The commit-graph\n+      # with changed-path filters answers from the filters (47 ms -> 2 ms a\n+      # lookup; spec pose-doctor-recommends-the-commit-graph).\n+      - name: Write the Git commit-graph with changed-path filters\n+        run: git commit-graph write --reachable --changed-paths\n       - uses: actions/setup-go@b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e # v7.0.0\n         with: { go-version: \"1.26.10\", cache: true, cache-dependency-path: pose-mcp/go.mod }\n       - name: Go tests (engine drift guard included)\n@@ -117,6 +123,12 @@ jobs:\n       # exactly this reason, reporting a governance defect that did not exist.\n       - uses: actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1 # v7.0.1\n         with: { fetch-depth: 0 }\n+      # Governance reads ask Git for the last commit that touched each\n+      # artifact; on the full history each lookup walks it. The commit-graph\n+      # with changed-path filters answers from the filters (47 ms -> 2 ms a\n+      # lookup; spec pose-doctor-recommends-the-commit-graph).\n+      - name: Write the Git commit-graph with changed-path filters\n+        run: git commit-graph write --reachable --changed-paths\n       - uses: actions/setup-go@b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e # v7.0.0\n         with: { go-version: \"1.26.10\", cache: true, cache-dependency-path: pose-mcp/go.mod }\n       - name: Build development pose binary\ndiff --git a/.pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json b/.pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json\nindex 966572c1..bb92d120 100644\n--- a/.pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json\n+++ b/.pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json\n@@ -2419,10 +2419,17 @@\n           \"severity\": \"required\",\n           \"evidenceClass\": \"integration\"\n         },\n+        {\n+          \"name\": \"doctor-recommends-the-commit-graph-integration\",\n+          \"program\": \"go\",\n+          \"args\": [\"test\", \"./internal/cli\", \"-run\", \"TestDoctorRecommendsTheCommitGraph|TestDoctorCommitGraphReportsAnUnreadableHistory\", \"-count=1\"],\n+          \"severity\": \"required\",\n+          \"evidenceClass\": \"integration\"\n+        },\n         {\n           \"name\": \"review-ledger-is-read-once-per-operation-integration\",\n           \"program\": \"go\",\n-          \"args\": [\"test\", \"./internal/pose\", \"-run\", \"TestReviewLedgerIsReadOncePerOperation|TestReviewLedgerWithoutAnOperationIsReadEveryTime|TestReviewLedgerMemoAnswersAsAFreshRead|TestReviewLedgerMemoComputesOnceForConcurrentMisses|TestReviewLedgerMemoGivesIsolatedCopies|TestCopyReviewRunsCoversEveryUnexportedField\", \"-count=1\"],\n+          \"args\": [\"test\", \"./internal/pose\", \"-run\", \"TestReviewLedgerIsReadOncePerOperation|TestReviewLedgerWithoutAnOperationIsReadEveryTime|TestReviewLedgerMemoAnswersAsAFreshRead|TestReviewLedgerMemoComputesOnceForConcurrentMisses|TestReviewLedgerMemoGivesIsolatedCopies|TestCopyReviewRunsCoversEveryUnexportedField|TestReviewLedgerMemoIsNotServedAfterTheOperationEnds\", \"-count=1\"],\n           \"severity\": \"required\",\n           \"evidenceClass\": \"integration\"\n         },\nrg: pose-mcp/internal/pose/raw*: IO error for operation on pose-mcp/internal/pose/raw*: No such file or directory (os error 2)\n","exit_code":2,"status":"failed"}}
