{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"I found two gaps: an operational failure while resolving HEAD still silently removes the check, and a filename containing Git pathspec syntax can prevent the probe from using valid filters. I also confirmed that disabling Bloom-filter reads makes the recommended write command insufficient. The existing integration tests do not cover these cases."}}
